---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-indigo-950 text-white py-20 overflow-hidden relative">
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-indigo-500 to-transparent"></div>
  
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-20">
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <a href="/" class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter mb-8 block">
          LEGO<span class="text-indigo-400">BUILDER</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-indigo-200/60 max-w-sm text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Construyendo el futuro del diseño web, un bloque a la vez. Únete a miles de creadores que ya están escalando sus ideas.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Explora</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-indigo-200/60">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Componentes</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Plantillas</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Precios</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Documentación</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Legal</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-indigo-200/60">
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Privacidad</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Términos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cookies</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="pt-10 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6">
      <p class="text-indigo-200/40 text-sm">
        © {currentYear} LegoBuilder. Creado con pasión para el mundo digital.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-6">
        <a href="#" class="text-indigo-200/40 hover:text-white transition-colors">Twitter</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-indigo-200/40 hover:text-white transition-colors">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#" class="text-indigo-200/40 hover:text-white transition-colors">Dribbble</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
